					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					160.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.74
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.31
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷος τεχνίτης
			παραπόλλυμαι</span>, =
			<i>qualis artifex pereo !</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				63.29
			</span></i>.</div>
